# Catalyst overnight cards

When running FULLCHECK, evening wrap, or next-day prep, follow
`.cursor/skills/catalyst-overnight-plan/SKILL.md` (packed copy:
`agents/ssr-st/skills/catalyst-overnight-plan/SKILL.md`).

Hard rule: listing an event without a take/arm/stand-down ticket that includes
structure, trigger, and same-day exit is a miss. "Stand down / don't chase"
after the open is not yesterday's plan.

Calendar must UNION Nasdaq `earnings_radar.md` + Robinhood earnings calendar +
fundamentals next-earnings on book/watch/peers + web search for investor/analyst/
capital-markets days. Write `agents/ssr-st/workspace/Documents/catalyst_cards.md`.
